  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Currently, searching for worlds in the new menu doesn't give good results due to the default settings. This is because the search results are being refined to just the 'Title' by default when it should be including 'Tag' and 'Description' as well.\nFor example if I was searching for \"train\" worlds I would expect to see every world that has to do with trains. But instead the results are already narrowed down to just the ones that have \"train\" in the title. It should be the opposite: the initial search should include every train relevant world and then if I want to narrow down the results more I can refine them myself from there.\nThis is extra confusing because the 'Quick World Searches' already do this, but our own searches don't. It's inconsistent and confusing.",
